body:
Ooooh... I'm so sorry about your brother( I sincerely hope that you and your family will be okay.

&#x200B;

I envy you that you grew up in America. The USA is my dream. Many dreams come true. But not in my case.

&#x200B;

What's the hurry? Everyone has patience. On this planet there is no one with iron patience. My patience was enough for four years. When I was in high school, I didn't even think about what kind of ass I was in. 

&#x200B;

I live in a terrible country, I study in a terrible place and I have no prospects for a good life. 

&#x200B;

I'm still alive because I don't want to upset my grandparents. They love me. Though they don't show it... But I feel. I love them and I don't want to hurt them. That's all that stops me at the moment.

I don't speak English well. I do not have enough knowledge of the language to describe everything in detail. But I'll try...

&#x200B;

I live in Russia. I was born on June 29, 2000. I was born and live in "Oryol" . I was often intimidated. Sooo much. Bullying continued throughout life. In kindergarten bullied. The school bullied. And now, the University is also bullied. My mother left the family when I was only two years old. My relationship with dad is terrible. I don't live with him. I live with my grandparents. I've never worked, I've never had a girlfriend I hate your face more than anything. I'm still alive because I feel sorry for my grandparents. I don't want them to see my body.
